# Keep main_figures/ tracked (remove the line that ignored it)
# The following two lines were removing images, now we only ignore generated outputs outside main_figures/
# We'll explicitly track main_figures/*.jpg and *.svg

# Ignore generated figures outside main_figures/
*.jpg
*.png
*.pdf
*.svg
!main_figures/
!main_figures/*.jpg
!main_figures/*.svg
!main_figures/*.png
!main_figures/*.pdf
